│                          │ objective. The true minimum remains the dominant term, while a very small secondary       │
│                          │ reward for the mean of the twelve smallest determinants encourages configurations with a  │
│                          │ broad, well-shaped active constraint set rather than a single fragile bottleneck. This is │
│                          │ particularly useful before the oriented SLSQP maximin polish: DE can enter a stronger     │
│                          │ combinatorial basin, while SLSQP still restores the exact maximin solution. The reduced   │
│                          │ DE iteration budget offsets the slightly more elaborate objective and improves evaluation │
│                          │ time.                                                                                     │
