│ patch_description        │ Add a final exact maximin polish using an epigraph variable and all 165 triangle-area     │
│                          │ constraints. The existing evolutionary and gradient stages are useful for locating a      │
│                          │ promising orientation cell, but their lower-tail surrogate and discrete proposals do not  │
│                          │ accurately equalize the true bottleneck triangles. Within a fixed determinant-sign cell,  │
│                          │ maximizing the epigraph variable is a smooth constrained optimization problem.            │
│                          │ Recomputing signs between a few phases permits controlled movement if the initial local   │
│                          │ search lies close to a sign-cell boundary. This is the same active-constraint balancing   │
│                          │ mechanism that is especially effective for the 11-point Heilbronn problem.                │
