│                          │ near-binding triples. Structured triangular-lattice seeds, boundary-support seeds, random │
│                          │ simplex seeds, particle velocity updates, periodic particle rejuvenation, and a final     │
│                          │ active-constraint coordinate refinement are combined. The final stage uses strict         │
│                          │ lexicographic comparison: raw minimum normalized area first, then the mean of the         │
│                          │ smallest determinants.                                                                    │
